// 1. is_rlc_wrapper==false, j_record_or_wrapper==NULL:
//        allocates new record, fills it and returns reference to it
// 2. is_rlc_wrapper==false, j_record_or_wrapper!=NULL:
//        copies data to record, returns copy of j_record_or_wrapper.
// 3. is_rlc_wrapper==true:
