// If any of the Java structure fields is null, corresponding field of the X-structure is initialized by zeros.
//    e_flag          -   on exception it is set to X_ASSERTION_FAILED, on success is not modified
//    e_msg           -   on exception it is set to error message, on success is not modified
//    
//EXCEPTIONS AND ERROR HANDLING:
//    this function sets e_flag only in the following cases:
//    * input is a non-rectangular matrix (rows sizes differ, some rows are null)
//    * input is a complex matrix that has null elements
